        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thuk duëli tin cieŋ kui̱ yiëër Jɔr-dɛn",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ cu gaat Rɛ-u-ben kɛnɛ gaat Gad tekɛ ɣɔ̱k ti ŋuan. Kä cukɛ mun Ya-dhɛr kɛnɛ mun Gil-yad nɛn ɛ mun la̱k ɣɔ̱ɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ ben kä Muthɛ kɛnɛ Ɛl-a-dhar bo̱o̱th palä kɛ bööth dolä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl jiök i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ä-ta-roth, kɛ Di-bon, kɛ Ya-dhɛr, kɛ Nim-raa kɛ Ɛc-bon, kɛ Ɛl-a-le, kɛ Thɛ-bam, kɛ Nɛbo, kɛnɛ Be-on, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mun ëë ci Kuoth Nhial ji̱kɛ jak kä na̱kɛ ɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, ɛ mun la̱k ɣɔ̱ɔ̱k. Kä te nɛy kɛ ɣɔ̱k.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kɛ wee i̱, “Mi nhɔki jɛ, käm ni nɛy mun ɛ mɔ ba̱kɔ ciɛŋ. /Cuarɛ kɔ lɛ naŋ kui̱ yiëër Jɔr-dɛn.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ gaat Rɛ-u-ben kɛnɛ gaat Gad jiök i̱, “Bi gaatmuɔɔri wä ko̱o̱r kä ku yɛn lɛ te nyuurä wa̱nɛ mi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛŋu bi yɛn lo̱c ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl jak kä jiäk ɔ kɛ wä muun in ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ ka̱m kɛ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn mëë ci guurikun ɛ la̱t mëë cä kɛ jäk kä Ka-dɛc-bar-ni-ya wa mun guic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ca mun nɛn kä Ɛc-kol cua lo̱c ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl jak kä jiäk kɛ wä muun in ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ ka̱mkɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial kɛ̈c ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ, kä cuɛ rɔ yac wee i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ɛ puc thilɛ ram mi bi mun nɛn kä nɛy tëë bä raar kä I-jëp a känɛ kä nɛy tin te run ti jiɛɛn da̱ŋ rɛw a wä nhial, mun ëë cä yac i̱ bä ka̱m Ab-ram kɛnɛ Ay-dhɛk kɛ Je-kɔb, kɛ ɣöö /ken kɛn ɣä guɔ̱ɔ̱r kɛ lɔcdiɛn kɛɛliw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ ni Ka-leb gat Yɛ-pö-nɛ raan Kɛ-nadh kɛnɛ Jɔ-cua gat Nun, kɛ ɣöö ca Kuoth Nhial guɔ̱ɔ̱r kɛ lɔcdiɛn kɛɛliw.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kɛ̈c Kuɔth Nhial ben kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, kä cuɛ kɛ jak kä yi̱c rɛy dɔaar kɛ run ti jiɛɛn ŋuaan, amäni mëë ci ri̱c ëë lät jiäk waaŋ Kuɔth Nhial thuɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä yɛn täämɛ cia gua̱th guuri ka̱n, yɛn ri̱c mi ji̱ dueeri, jak yɛn waŋ lɔaac Kuɔth Nhial kɛ ɣöö bɛ rɔ nyɔk kɛ ben kä I-thɛ-rɛl! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi wä yɛn rɔ ri̱t kɔɔrɛ, bɛ nɛy ti̱ti̱ nyɔk kɛ päl däärdɔaar. A bi yɛn kɛ jak kä duɔ̱p kɛn diaal.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ ben thieekä Muthɛ kä cukɛ wee i̱, “Ba̱kɔ detkɔ lät kä lueek ɛn wa̱nɛ kä ba̱kɔ gaatkɔ lät kä ti̱ec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ba̱kɔ wä ko̱o̱r kɛɛl kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, amäni mi ca̱kɔ kɛ naŋ guäthdiɛn. Mi wä gaatkɔ te rɛy ti̱ecni ti buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m kɛ kui̱ nɛɛni tin ciaŋ kɛ mun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /ca̱kɔ rɔ bi ri̱t amäni mi ci ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl gua̱thkiɛn ka̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö /ca̱kɔ bi wä cieŋ kɛɛl kɛ kɛ kui̱ yiëër Jɔr-dɛn a wä nhiam. Kɛ gua̱a̱thda ni kui̱ yiëër Jɔr-dɛn kui̱c käny ca̱ŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Mi bia nɛmɛ la̱t, a bia wä ko̱o̱r nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a bi wutni köörun diaal wä kui̱ yiëër Jɔr-dɛn nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, amäni mi cɛ ji̱ tɛ̈rɛ joc nhiamdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cia mun ka̱n nhiamdɛ. Kɛ kɔrɛ bia rɔ cu ri̱t, kä bia cu thil riɛk kä Kuoth Nhial kɛnɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. Kä bi mun ɛ mi a duŋ duŋdun nhiam Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi /cia nɛmɛ bi la̱t, ŋa̱cɛ jɛ i̱, cia duer lät kä Kuoth Nhial. Kä ŋa̱cɛ jɛ bi duerun yɛ jek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ta̱thɛ gaatkun ti̱ec kä la̱tdɛ detkun kä lueek. Kä la̱tdɛ min cia lar.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaat Rɛ-u-ben kɛnɛ gaat Gad Muthɛ jiök i̱, “Bakɔ la̱t ce̱tnikɛ min ci lar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi gaatkɔ, kɛ mänkɔ, kɛ detkɔ, nikɛ ɣɔ̱ɔ̱kɔ diaal duɔth wi̱i̱ni Gil-yad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɔn wutni ko̱o̱r diaal ba̱kɔ wä ko̱o̱r kui̱ yiëër Jɔr-dɛn nhiam Kuɔth Nhial ce̱tnikɛ min ci lar.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ ruac kɛ Ɛl-a-dhar bo̱o̱th palä kɛnɛ Jɔ-cua gat Nun kɛ bööth thuk duëli ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Mi wä gaat Gad kɛnɛ gaat Rɛ-u-ben wutni ko̱o̱r wä ko̱o̱r nhiam Kuɔth Nhial kui̱ yiëër Jɔr-dɛn a bia mun ka̱n, bia kɛ ka̱m mun Gil-yad ba ciɛŋ ɛ kɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö mi /kenkɛ wä kui̱ yiëër Jɔr-dɛn kɛɛl kɛ yɛ, bikɛ cieŋ rɛydun muun Kɛ-naan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaat Rɛ-u-ben kɛnɛ gaat Gad jɛ loc i̱, “Ce̱tkɛ min ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ lar ba̱kɔ la̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba̱kɔ wä ko̱o̱r Nhiam Kuɔth Nhial Muun Kɛ-naan, bi gua̱th ciɛŋäda te kui̱ yiëër Jɔr-dɛn.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
